---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About · unbeholden.dev">
	<section class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-[clamp(24px,5vw,72px)] gap-y-12">
		<div class="min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[480px] sm:max-w-[620px] text-[19px] leading-[1.8]">
			<p class="meta mb-[clamp(28px,4vw,44px)] tracking-[0.18em]">About</p>
			<p>
				I'm Jakub. Software you depend on should be software you can inspect, move, and turn off.
				That is a practical position, not a political one. What interests me is what it costs, what
				it breaks, and whether it holds up on a Tuesday when something goes wrong.
			</p>
			<p class="text-dim mt-[26px]">
				Everything here runs on hardware I own or a VPS I pay for. No sponsorships, no affiliate
				links, no third-party analytics, no comments and no share buttons. Replies come by email. If
				a build fails I publish the failure.
			</p>
			<p class="text-dim mt-[26px]">
				The same applies to tools. When the thing I need doesn't exist, or exists only as a service
				someone else can withdraw, I write it and publish it here. Usually small, usually specific to
				one problem.
			</p>
			<p class="text-dim mt-[26px]">Prose is CC BY 4.0. Code is CC0/MIT.</p>
		</div>
		<div
			class="text-dim flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[260px] flex-col gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] leading-[2] tracking-[0.06em] sm:max-w-[240px]"
		>
			<a href="mailto:hello@unbeholden.dev"
				>Email<br /><span class="text-faint">hello@unbeholden.dev</span></a
			>
			<a href="/feed.xml" class="text-accent"
				>RSS<br /><span class="text-faint">unbeholden.dev/feed.xml</span></a
			>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
